<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy — Sanctum Technologies</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --bg-primary: #08080e;
      --bg-card: rgba(16, 16, 26, 0.55);
      --border: rgba(30, 30, 48, 0.5);
      --text-primary: #eeeef8;
      --text-secondary: #8888aa;
      --text-muted: #555570;
      --accent: #ff00aa;
      --accent-glow: rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.4);
      --blue: #00ccff;
    }
    html, body { height: 100%; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; background: var(--bg-primary); color: var(--text-primary); }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-glow); }

    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; }
      to { opacity: 1; }
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px;
      animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease-out;
    }

    .header {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 48px; animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-out; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
    }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .brand-icon { font-size: 22px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 900; text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent-glow); }
    .brand-name { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--blue)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
    .back-link { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); padding: 8px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .back-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

    .card {
      background: rgba(16, 16, 26, 0.45); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px; animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease-out 0.1s both; position: relative;
    }
    .card::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--blue));
      border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
    }

    h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 32px; }

    .section { margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .section-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .section-content { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary); }
    .section-content strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }
    .section-content ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 8px 0; }
    .section-content li { margin-bottom: 4px; }

    .divider { height: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); margin: 28px 0; }

    .footer-text { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 32px; animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-out 0.3s both; }
  </style>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="brand">
        <span class="brand-icon">✦</span>
        <span class="brand-name">SANCTUM TECHNOLOGIES</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px;">
        <a href="/impressum" class="back-link">Impressum</a>
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Last updated: January 2026</p>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">1. Data Controller</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <strong>Marcel Bender</strong><br>
          Finkenweg 18<br>
          57578 Elkenroth<br>
          Germany<br>
          Email: <a href="mailto:bendermarcel79&#64;gmail.com">bendermarcel79&#64;gmail.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">2. What Data We Collect</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <strong>When you use the Discord Bot:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Your Discord user ID, username, and discriminator</li>
            <li>Server (guild) IDs where the bot is present</li>
            <li>Channel IDs and message IDs relevant to bot features (tickets, logging, suggestions, etc.)</li>
            <li>Command usage data necessary to execute the requested functionality</li>
          </ul>
          <br>
          <strong>When you use the Dashboard:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Discord account information (ID, username, avatar) obtained via OAuth2 login</li>
            <li>Your IP address is temporarily processed during login</li>
            <li>Session data stored in a cookie to keep you logged in</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">3. How We Use Your Data</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          Your data is used solely for the purpose of operating and providing the bot and dashboard services:
          <ul>
            <li>To process and respond to commands</li>
            <li>To manage server configurations, tickets, suggestions, and moderation features</li>
            <li>To authenticate you on the dashboard and display your server list</li>
            <li>To generate activity statistics (anonymized) displayed in the dashboard overview</li>
            <li>To send optional webhook notifications (e.g., login alerts) if configured</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">4. Data Storage</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          Data is stored in a MySQL database hosted on a dedicated server within the European Union. We retain data only as long as necessary to provide the services. When the bot is removed from a server, associated configuration data may be retained for up to 30 days before being deleted, unless you request earlier removal.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">5. Data Sharing</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          We do <strong>not</strong> sell, trade, or share your personal data with third parties. Exceptions:
          <ul>
            <li>Discord API — necessary for bot and OAuth2 authentication functionality</li>
            <li>Lavalink node — music playback data is sent to a remote audio server (lava1.mineserver.it:6004)</li>
            <li>Legal obligations — if required by law or enforceable governmental request</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">6. Cookies & Sessions</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          The dashboard uses a session cookie to maintain your login state. This cookie is strictly necessary for authentication and does not track you across websites. No analytics or advertising cookies are used.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">7. Your Rights (GDPR)</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          As a user in the European Union, you have the following rights under the GDPR:
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Right of access</strong> — request a copy of the data we hold about you</li>
            <li><strong>Right to rectification</strong> — request correction of inaccurate data</li>
            <li><strong>Right to erasure</strong> — request deletion of your data ("right to be forgotten")</li>
            <li><strong>Right to restrict processing</strong> — request limitation of data usage</li>
            <li><strong>Right to data portability</strong> — request your data in a structured, machine-readable format</li>
            <li><strong>Right to object</strong> — object to the processing of your data</li>
          </ul>
          To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:bendermarcel79&#64;gmail.com">bendermarcel79&#64;gmail.com</a>. We will respond within 30 days.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">8. Data Security</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data, including encrypted database connections (TLS) and session secret management. However, no method of electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">9. Third-Party Services</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Discord</strong> — authentication and bot services. See <a href="https://discord.com/privacy" target="_blank">Discord's Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><strong>Lavalink</strong> — music playback via a remote audio node</li>
            <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — the dashboard uses the Inter font loaded from Google's CDN</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">10. Changes to This Policy</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">11. Contact</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this privacy policy, please contact:<br><br>
          <strong>Marcel Bender</strong><br>
          Finkenweg 18<br>
          57578 Elkenroth<br>
          Germany<br>
          Email: <a href="mailto:bendermarcel79&#64;gmail.com">bendermarcel79&#64;gmail.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-text">
      &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Sanctum Technologies
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>